cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "puuwaawaa-normalization: normalization methods for MCDA conservation planning"
abstract: >-
  Code implementing global linear, vector (Euclidean), and within-unit
  normalization for multi-criteria decision analysis, with a concentration
  ratio diagnostic and tradeoff frontier analysis, applied to the
  Puʻuwaʻawaʻa Forest Reserve case study.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/olesonlab/puuwaawaa-normalization"
identifiers:
